 h-bro Troy (Jimmy Tatro) arrives to run the property (into the ground)\, A
 mos\, Rebecca-Diane and production manager Glenn (Noah Galvin) band togeth
 er with the staff and students to stage a masterpiece and keep their belov
 ed summer camp afloat.\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com
