 nths\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nJoin us for a Chapters of Chicago conversa
 tion with Tonika Lewis Johnson\, author of Don't Go: Stories of Segregatio
 n and How to Disrupt It . Through photography and storytelling\, Johnson e
 xamines how segregation continues to shape Chicago\, and challenges us to 
 think about what it means to stay\, leave\, and truly know the city we liv
 e in. As part of our Chapters of Chicago Summer Learning series\, this pro
 gram invites you to see your neighborhood\, and others\, with more clarity
 \, context\, and care. E\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.c
