BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[FREE] Moth Week! The Secret Lives of Moths: Uncovering Hidden Nig
 httime S…
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260722T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260722T130000
DTSTAMP:20260628T102919Z
UID:45a5a19599a2af0d72524536a880e564@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:museum,science,family,all_audiences
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Field Museum - Events\\nCost: Included with admissi
 on\\nAges: All ages\\nCategory: General\\n\\nMost moths live their lives a
 fter dark — and most of their stories go untold. Celebrate Moth Week wit
 h Field Museum scientists from the Negaunee Integrative Research and Kelle
 r Science Action Centers to explore the secret lives of moths\, from their
  stunning diversity and surprising behaviors to their roles as pollinators
  and indicators of environmental change! See real specimens\, ask question
 s\, and discover why these nighttime insects matter. You’ll be enchanted
  by spectacular specimens of the moths you know and love\, and be astonish
 ed to meet some surprising native pollinators that call Chicago home\, too
 . Learn about how you can take action to help native plants and pollinator
 s\, and take home a free Field Guide to help you identify the native plant
 s and pollinators of Chicagoland. Presenters for this session include Alis
 sa Doucet\, Field Museum Scientific Affiliate (Insects)\, and Nicole Machu
 ca\, Environmental Social Scientist\, Chicago Region (Field Museum's Kelle
 r Science Action Center)\\n\\nMore info: https://www.fieldmuseum.org/our-e
 vents/meet-a-scientist/moth-week-the-secret-lives-of-moths
LOCATION:Field Museum\, 1400 S Lake Shore Dr\, Chicago\, IL 60605
URL:https://www.fieldmuseum.org/our-events/meet-a-scientist/moth-week-the-
 secret-lives-of-moths
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow: Moth Week! The Secret Lives of Moths: Uncovering Hid
 den Nigh
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:In 2 hours: Moth Week! The Secret Lives of Moths: Uncovering H
 idden Nigh
TRIGGER:-PT2H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
